ternally supplied records may have no corresponding unified-storage resources or user-level authorization rules. When the owning service must apply its own authorization checks before returning results to a user, restrict reads to that service so callers cannot bypass those checks.","+","+In `custom.ini`, set `vector_allowed_read_services` to a JSON map of `group/resource` collections and allowed service identities:","+","+```ini","+[unified_storage]","+vector_allowed_read_services = {\"example.ext.grafana.app/records\":[\"example-service\"]}","+```","+","+For a configured collection, `HybridSearch` and `VectorSearch` accept only authenticated access-policy tokens with exactly one matching service identity.","+User and on-behalf-of tokens are denied.","+The check covers every target before vector or lexical search; one denied target rejects the whole request.","+Existing tenant and resource `get` checks still apply.","+","+An unset value or `{}` leaves both search methods unchanged; invalid values prevent server startup.","+Deploy support to every serving storage and search server before setting the restriction because older versions ignore it.","+Before rolling back server support, disable the collection on every serving route.","+"," ## Running load tests"," Load tests and instructions can be found [here](https://github.com/grafana/grafana-api-tests/tree/main/simulation/src/unified_storage)."," "],"additions":20,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pkg/storage/unified/resource/search.go","lines":["@@ -536,6 +536,7 @@ type searchServer struct {"," \trateLimitPerTenant     int"," \trateLimitWindow        time.Duration"," \tcollectionAllowlist    vector.CollectionAllowlist","+\tallowedReadServices    map[string][]string"," \tembeddingBuilders      embed.BuilderProvider"," "," \townsIndexFn func(key NamespacedResource) (bool, error)","@@ -682,6 +683,7 @@ func newSearchServer(opts SearchOptions, storage StorageBackend, vectorBackend v"," \t\trateLimitPerTenant:   